- $b = 100$: $21 = 3\cdot7$;
- $b = 144$: $25$;
- $b = 256$: $33 = 3 \cdot 11$;
- $b = 900$: $61$, prime ✓ ($961 - 900 = 61$);
- $b = 10\,000$: $201 = 3\cdot67$.

So $b = 900$.

**Answer: (D) 900**

